{"id":"8ed8a780d077dd76","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-TB-completeness.md","title":"保守去引号系统中基础真理原子的可证性","display":"thm-TB-completeness — 保守去引号系统中基础真理原子的可证性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-TB-completeness","aliases":["91-thm-TB-completeness"],"display":"thm-TB-completeness — 保守去引号系统中基础真理原子的可证性","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-thm-CT-conservative]]","[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-TB-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-TB-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-TB-completeness — 保守去引号系统中基础真理原子的可证性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f32c7d95792dcee2\" href=\"?note=f32c7d95792dcee2\" title=\"91-thm-CT-conservative\">91-thm-CT-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73ccb673e6681e3d\" href=\"?note=73ccb673e6681e3d\" title=\"91-thm-compositional-completeness\">91-thm-compositional-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\}\\)</span> 使用原书相应版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向右用基础双条件的 T-out 得 U⊢φ，再用算术保守性；向左继承 PA 证明再用 T-in。TB、UTB 的完整归纳版本都在结论中，CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 只有基础归纳。\n文件名的 completeness 仅表示相对于 PA 定理的精确对应，不表示所有真句都可证或所有句子都可判定。这里没有把保守性作为待满足的任意条件，而使用已有实际保守定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5、Lemma 8.4、Theorem 8.5 的直接推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-CT-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\{\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-TB-completeness]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["7e76f1ecb9ab7743","f32c7d95792dcee2","73ccb673e6681e3d"]}